      10: '[Maalouf et al. (2007) — Ketones inhibit mitochondrial production of reactive oxygen species production following glutamate excitotoxicity by increasing NADH oxidation.](/docs/papers/BRAIN-Diet-References#brs4_maalouf2007_20261023)'
      11: '[Trewin et al. (2017) — Acute exercise alters skeletal muscle mitochondrial respiration and H2O2 emission in response to hyperinsulinemic-euglycemic clamp in middle-aged obese men.](/docs/papers/BRAIN-Diet-References#brs4_acuteexercise2017_20261023)'
      12: '[Jarrett et al. (2008) — The ketogenic diet increases mitochondrial glutathione levels.](/docs/papers/BRAIN-Diet-References#brs4_jarrett2008_20261023)'
