      3: '[Öğütlü et al. (2022) — Mitochondrial Dysfunction in Attention Deficit Hyperactivity Disorder](/docs/papers/BRAIN-Diet-References#ogutlu_mitochondrial_2023)'
      4: '[Brand et al. (2016) — Suppressors of Superoxide-H2O2 Production at Site IQ of Mitochondrial Complex I Protect against Stem Cell Hyperplasia and Ischemia-Reperfusion Injury.](/docs/papers/BRAIN-Diet-References#brs4_brand2016_20261023)'
      5: '[Chouchani et al. (2014) — Ischaemic accumulation of succinate controls reperfusion injury through mitochondrial ROS.](/docs/papers/BRAIN-Diet-References#brs4_chouchani2014_20261023)'
      6: '[Guzy et al. (2005) — Mitochondrial complex III is required for hypoxia-induced ROS production and cellular oxygen sensing.](/docs/papers/BRAIN-Diet-References#brs4_guzy2005_20261023)'
      7: '[Anderson et al. (2009) — Mitochondrial H2O2 emission and cellular redox state link excess fat intake to insulin resistance in both rodents and humans.](/docs/papers/BRAIN-Diet-References#brs4_anderson2009_20261023)'
