              1:
                doi: '10.1007/s00125-016-4170-6'
                role: 'Contextual recovery; not exact-protocol replication'
                access: 'Full publisher PDF Methods, Table 1 and Results'
                assessment: 'Different two-week interval protocol, now fully recovered and assessed separately as PM2-F7; no retroactive replication credit.'
            retrievalLimited:
          recommendation: 'V1 proposes the explicitly observational wording above. The old causal claim and its 2/8 assessment remain archived; no confidence is transferred to broader aerobic advice.'
