            P: 'Gram Figs 8–10 show SEM and protocol-specific comparisons at fixed potential, supporting the scoped direction. Recovery varies by respiratory state, comparator-leg changes occur, and age/size estimates remain uncertain; P1 applies without claiming complete recovery in every state.'
