                role: 'supporting exact scoped proposition'
                access: 'full text HTML recovered'
                assessment: 'SLC25A39 was required to maintain mitochondrial GSH; experiments highlighted iron–sulfur-cluster biology rather than establishing antioxidant buffering as the sole essential function. Not an oral precursor trial; organelle GSH concentration is not protective flux.'
              1:
                doi: '10.1038/s41467-022-30126-9'
                role: 'supporting exact scoped proposition'
                access: 'full text XML recovered'
                assessment: 'SLC25A39 loss impaired GSH import and OXPHOS; intramitochondrial labelled GSSG supported use of imported GSH. GSSG labelling does not isolate GPX4 activity or prove protection from a dietary precursor.'
              2:
