                role: 'supporting exact scoped proposition'
                access: 'full text HTML recovered'
                assessment: 'Mitochondrial membrane composition and ADP sensitivity changed; maximal ROS emission increased while measured 4HNE and protein oxidation did not. No placebo comparison; tested mixture, not independent effects of either constituent or ordinary fish.'
            retrievalLimited:
              0:
                url: 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3961091/'
                limitation: 'Recover paired raw/summary damage-marker data and resolve the claim wording: propose “no statistically detected increase in the measured whole-muscle markers” for scientific review, without changing the canonical Finding in this scoring pass. Do not equate whole-muscle nulls with absence of mitochondrial injury.'
            contradictoryAssessment: 'No significant increase in selected damage markers is retained; equivalence and absence of harm are not established.'
          evidenceLocations:
