          followUp: 'Recover paired raw/summary damage-marker data and resolve the claim wording: propose “no statistically detected increase in the measured whole-muscle markers” for scientific review, without changing the canonical Finding in this scoring pass. Do not equate whole-muscle nulls with absence of mitochondrial injury.'
