                access: 'Scite complete body, Methods, Results, Discussion and figure captions'
                assessment: 'Stress corticosterone increased and suppression was impaired; tested central/adrenal GR expression and adrenal ACTH responsiveness did not explain the result. Baseline leptin and adiponectin did not differ. Adiponectin-Cre specificity not exhaustive; knockdown varied by depot, mediator unresolved, and no human intervention.'
