                children: ["Processing can alter the temporal response without demonstrating a change in total measured exposure. The tested extruded mycoprotein/pea blend changed selected early plasma amino-acid responses, while the integrated five-hour grouped responses were not significantly different. Unlike the beef experiment, this study did not use a dietary tracer; the endpoints must not be treated as interchangeable or as proof of equal absorption. ", _jsx(_components.a, {
