      - id: PM2-F2
        finding_label: A meal protocol affects acute glucose variability
        presentation: mechanistic-basis
        fm_rollup: false
        finding_summary: Fish before rice reduced within-meal glucose variability in the diabetes group.
        finding_statement: Fish before rice reduced within-meal glucose variability in the diabetes group.
        finding_interpretation: 'This tests the excursion pattern, while PM1 considers its upstream emptying link.'
        synthesis: 'This tests the excursion pattern, while PM1 considers its upstream emptying link.'
        synthesis_limitations: Acute sequence-specific effects do not establish day-long stability.
        synthesised_evidence_confidence: not-yet-scored
