      - kc_id: BRS6(KC1)
        ikc_id: BRS6(KC1)
        arm_id: PM2-KC1-review
        disposition: unresolved
        proposition: Does the narrowed circulating-glucose availability pool establish a PM-specific upstream supply or conditional constraint?
        rationale: The existing KC1 assessment narrows the pool to circulating glucose availability. Its cerebral-energy relevance does not automatically admit this PM or a checklist of meal nutrients.
        evidence_source:
          finding_ids:
            - PM2-F1
          citation_keys:
