          rationale: Remove the old universal human-MAT-flux gate. Supported animal/molecular triangulation is permissible. This corpus still does not establish a further distinct sulfur-pool limitation beyond methionine provision.
          evidence_gap: 'A context-specific limitation beyond the independently recorded methionine substrate provision, with pool scope, compensation and SAM production/consumption distinguished.'
          review_record: system/kc-unresolved-decisions-reconciliation.md
